<title>GERMANY: Buba - no press conference after council meeting.</title>
<headline>Buba - no press conference after council meeting.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank will not hold a press conference after its regular council meeting today, the central bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>Economists expect the Bundesbank to keep all its interest rates on hold at the gathering.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom + 49 69 756525</p>
</text>
